<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Westpac appoints John Fairfax to board.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Westpac appoints John Fairfax to board.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Westpac Banking Corp Ltd said on Tuesday that Rural Press Ltd chairman John B. Fairfax had been appointed to the bank's board.</p>
<p>The appointment would take effect from December 5.</p>
<p>Westpac chairman John Uhrig said Fairfax had a deep understanding of the financial service needs of the commercial and rural sectors.</p>
<p>Fairfax is also chairman of Marinya Media Pty Ltd, independent print group Print Group Pty Ltd and Cambooya Investments Ltd. He is also a director of GE Crane Holdings.  -- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
